<h2>~rThunder Lord</h2>
<p>Hmmph!  What kind of fool are you?  
$Timeout=4,DoNothing,0

[@3]
<h2>~rThunder Lord</h2>
<p>You can't hope to penetrate my stronghold with your puny arsenal!!! 
$Timeout=6,DoNothing,0

[@600]
<?!{atobjective1}>
<h2>~rThunder Lord</h2>
<p>Haha!  Fool!  You should leave with your life now!</?> 
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@900]
<?!{atobjective1}>
<h2>~rThunder Lord</h2>
<p>You surprise me...still you can't hope to win this.</?>
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@1200]
<?!{atobjective1}>
<h2>~rThunder Lord</h2>
<p>Surrender!  You have no hope to win this fight!</?>
$Timeout=4,DoNothing,0


[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Thunder Lord</h2>
<i>"Better to be shocked by thunder, than to be fried by lightning."<br>
-- Unknown</i>  
<p>You see the Thunder Lord's massive fortress.  Do you have the power to even dent his mighty walls?
-
